  "question": {
    "text": "The activity of a radioactive material is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>56</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi>Ci</mi></math>. If the half life of the material is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> days, after how many days the activity will become <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mi>Ci</mi></math>?"
  },
